{"suttaId":"thag2.11","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[792,798],"vripara":"141"},"segments":{"thag2.11:0.4":"Mahācundattheragāthā","thag2.11:1.1":"“Sussūsā sutavaddhanī, sutaṃ paññāya vaddhanaṃ;","thag2.11:1.3":"Paññāya atthaṃ jānāti, ñāto attho sukhāvaho.","thag2.11:2.1":"“Sevetha pantāni senāsanāni, careyya saṃyojanavippamokkhaṃ;","thag2.11:2.3":"Sace ratiṃ nādhigaccheyya tattha, saṅghe vase rakkhitatto satimā”ti.","thag2.11:2.5":"… Mahācundo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
